# Runtime data — the served zarr stores (symlinks to processed_zarr/) and
# per-user sessions are NOT committed; they are large/host-specific runtime
# artifacts. The coverage manifest + its build/check scripts ARE committed:
# they are the source of truth for what coverage *should* be.
datasets/
sessions/

# but keep the manifest + tooling tracked
!build_manifest.py
!check_coverage.sh
!SERVED_DATASETS.tsv
!SERVED_DATASETS.md
!.gitignore
